  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Weather and Information Services Project to increase the quality, accessibility and use of these services</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project co-produces climate data to support decision making, to build resilience to climate change impacts. Activities involve strengthening regional climate centre capacity and working with humanitarian partners to ensure that weather and climate information services support their anticipatory action.</narrative>
  </description>
